1. baresip  (https://github.com/baresip/baresip)
------------------------------------------------

The Medut stack under src/ is Medut's own, built on libre.  Parts of it
are adapted from baresip; each such file says so in its header.  So far:

  src/sip/sip_stack.c   from src/uag.c and modules/uuid/uuid.c
  src/sip/ua.c          from src/ua.c, src/account.c and src/custom_hdrs.c
  src/sip/reg.c         from src/reg.c
  src/sip/sipreq.c      from src/sipreq.c
  src/sip/message.c     from src/message.c
  src/sip/mwi.c         from modules/mwi/mwi.c
  src/sip/presence.c    from modules/presence/ (subscriber.c, notifier.c,
                        publisher.c; publisher.c also Copyright (C) 2014
                        Juha Heinanen)
  src/sip/call.c        from src/call.c
  src/sip/call_api.c    from src/ua.c and src/account.c
  src/media/stream.c, rtprecv.c, jbuf.c, audio.c, aureceiver.c, metric.c,
  timestamp.c, sdp.c, aucodec.c, menc.c, rtpstat.c
                        from the files of the same name in src/
  src/media/mdt_media.h, src/sip/mdt_call.h
                        from include/baresip.h and src/core.h
  src/codec/g711.c      from modules/g711/g711.c
  src/codec/opus.c, opus_enc.c, opus_dec.c, opus_sdp.c, opus.h
                        from modules/opus/ (opus.c, encode.c, decode.c,
                        sdp.c, opus.h)
  src/menc/dtls_srtp.c, dtls.c, dtls_srtp_keys.c, dtls_srtp.h
                        from modules/dtls_srtp/ (dtls_srtp_keys.c is its
                        srtp.c)
  src/menc/sdes_srtp.c, sdes.c, sdes.h
                        from modules/srtp/ (sdes_srtp.c is its srtp.c)
  src/core/stack.c      local-address selection from src/net.c
  platform/linux/pulse*.c, pulse.h       from modules/pulse/
  platform/macos/coreaudio*.c, *.h      from modules/coreaudio/
  platform/windows/wasapi*.c, wasapi.h  from modules/wasapi/
  platform/ios/audiounit*.c, *.h        from modules/audiounit/
  src/core/mod.c        mdt_mediadev from src/mediadev.c
  src/core/mod.c        the plug-in registries (src/ausrc.c, src/auplay.c,
                        src/aufilt.c, src/mnat.c)

